DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10974::$$$message_0086_0000_0000$$$::"Good morning, Ms. Fujimura."[lr]::
10975::$$$message_0086_0000_0001$$$::"Morning, is everyone doing well?"[lr]::
10976::$$$message_0086_0000_0002$$$::A casual greeting unseemly for a teacher in the morning.[lr]::
10977::$$$message_0086_0000_0003$$$::...Well, it's Fuji-nee. It would be weird if she talked formally or something.::
10978::$$$message_0086_0001_0000$$$::"Which isn't a problem, but slouching like that is a bit..."[lr]::
10979::$$$message_0086_0001_0001$$$::"What? [cacheimage storage=藤05a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=藤05a(中) time=300 textoff=0]Is something troubling you, Shirou?"[lr]::
10980::$$$message_0086_0001_0002$$$::Fuji-nee found me tilting my head.[lr]::
10981::$$$message_0086_0001_0003$$$::We're a teacher and student here, but homeroom hasn't even started.::
10982::$$$message_0086_0002_0000$$$::"Well, I thought it wasn't like the usual Fuji-nee."[lr]::
10983::$$$message_0086_0002_0001$$$::"Hmmm. [cacheimage storage=藤08c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08c(中) textoff=0]So what you're trying to say is that I'm not like a teacher."[lr]::
10984::$$$message_0086_0002_0002$$$::"I wouldn't go that far, but... Yeah, there's nothing really wrong right now."::
10985::$$$message_0086_0003_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=藤01b(中) textoff=0]We always see each other, so we know too much about each other's problems.[lr]::
10986::$$$message_0086_0003_0001$$$::I guess you could say it'd be an ideal relationship for an instructor and pupil[line len=2]Really though, you'd call us more like siblings.::
10987::$$$message_0086_0004_0000$$$::"Mm, you need to be more serious, Shirou."[lr]::
10988::$$$message_0086_0004_0001$$$::"Huh? Something happen?"[lr]::
10989::$$$message_0086_0004_0002$$$::"Graduation isn't far, but you're still floating around. That's not good.[cacheimage storage=藤10b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤10b(中) textoff=0] I'm worried as a teacher."[lr]::
10990::$$$message_0086_0004_0003$$$::She sounds like she's lamenting her lot in life, but there's no actual bitterness.[lr]::
10991::$$$message_0086_0004_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=藤02b腕b(中)]I guess that sense of casualness is why other students seem comfortable approaching her with their troubles.::
10992::$$$message_0086_0005_0000$$$::"You need to trust your teacher more and come to me for advice."[lr]::
10993::$$$message_0086_0005_0001$$$::"About tonight's dinner?"[lr]::
10994::$$$message_0086_0005_0002$$$::"Oh, I want something protein heavy![cacheimage storage=藤06a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=藤06a(中) textoff=0] You need protein and lipids for energy!"[lr]::
10995::$$$message_0086_0005_0003$$$::This is what she's talking about first thing in the morning.[lr]::
10996::$$$message_0086_0005_0004$$$::And like a shadow, another makes his way past us...::
10997::$$$message_0086_0006_0000$$$::"Good morning, Mr. Kuzuki."[lr]::
10998::$$$message_0086_0006_0001$$$::"Oh, good morning."[lr]::
10999::$$$message_0086_0006_0002$$$::"Morning."[lr]::
11000::$$$message_0086_0006_0003$$$::The strict ethics teacher, Mr. Kuzuki, is here.[lr]::
11001::$$$message_0086_0006_0004$$$::Just as it's been said that Mr. Kuzuki is looked up to more by the upperclassmen, I'm also starting to understand his charm as a third year.::
11002::$$$message_0086_0007_0000$$$::"Ms. Fujimura, I would like to talk to you about this month's schedule."[lr]::
11003::$$$message_0086_0007_0001$$$::"Regarding the prep for the cultural festival and midterm exams, correct? [cacheimage storage=藤01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤01a(中) textoff=0]Also, when was the regular faculty meeting decided on?"[lr]::
11004::$$$message_0086_0007_0002$$$::"It is this evening. We also have the third years' future course guidance."[lr]::
11005::$$$message_0086_0007_0003$$$::"I understand, future courses are a lot of work. But you are admired by your students..."::
11006::$$$message_0086_0008_0000$$$::A serious work conversation is happening here.[lr]::
11007::$$$message_0086_0008_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=葛木01a眼鏡(中) textoff=0][line len=3]I can't help but rub my eyes to make sure I'm not dreaming.::
11008::$$$message_0086_0009_0000$$$::"No, I haven't gained as much popularity as you, Ms. Fujimura."[lr]::
11009::$$$message_0086_0009_0001$$$::"That is not true; [cacheimage storage=藤08d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08d(中) textoff=0]see, Emiya is making a face like he agrees with me."[lr]::
11010::$$$message_0086_0009_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=葛木01a眼鏡(中) textoff=0]Don't drag me into the conversation, Fuji-nee.[lr]::
11011::$$$message_0086_0009_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=藤01a(中) textoff=0]But she can't fool around like her usual self in front of Mr. Kuzuki.::
11012::$$$message_0086_0010_0000$$$::"I think that Mr. Kuzuki is a reliable teacher."[lr]::
11013::$$$message_0086_0010_0001$$$::"...I see. I shall work hard to live up to your belief. [cacheimage storage=葛木01a眼鏡(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=葛木01a眼鏡(中) textoff=0]Well, then."[lr]::
11014::$$$message_0086_0010_0002$$$::Mr. Kuzuki[clfg rule=シャッター左から storage=葛木01a眼鏡(中) time=300 textoff=0] heads off to his classroom.[lr]::
11015::$$$message_0086_0010_0003$$$::Once his lean figure disappears down the hallway, the tension leaves my body, and Fuji-nee slaps my shoulder.::
11016::$$$message_0086_0011_0000$$$::"Look at you, acting all goody goody."[lr]::
11017::$$$message_0086_0011_0001$$$::"You also put on an act all of a sudden... So you can do it if you try."[lr]::
11018::$$$message_0086_0011_0002$$$::"What's that, you say? Am I some kind of troublemaker or problem child? You looking down on me like I'm a little girl?"[lr]::
11019::$$$message_0086_0011_0003$$$::She really is emphasizing the girl part.[lr]::
11020::$$$message_0086_0011_0004$$$::"...Without a doubt. Aren't I also a bad kid since I was raised by such a bad kid[wvl][se storage=se020.wav]..."[lr]::
11021::$$$message_0086_0011_0005$$$::It seems like we used up the time before homeroom period.::
11022::$$$message_0086_0012_0000$$$::"Oh, it's time. Hmm, you're not a bad kid.[lr]::
11023::$$$message_0086_0012_0001$$$::Now, let's get you to class."[lr]::
11024::$$$message_0086_0012_0002$$$::"...Wow. You're actually gonna be on time today[line len=2]"[lr]::
11025::$$$message_0086_0012_0003$$$::"Hiya!"::
11026::$$$message_0086_0013_0000$$$::She lets out a weird yell and starts running. Hey![lr]::
11027::$$$message_0086_0013_0001$$$::That serious teacher from moments ago seems like a lie[line len=2]::
11028::$$$message_0086_0014_0000$$$::"Come on, you'll be tardy if you don't make it on time, Emiya!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
11029::$$$message_0086_0014_0001$$$::"Guh, more than a bad kid, she's a riddle wrapped in an enigma...!"::
911006::$$$message_9086_0008_0000$$$::A serious work conversation is happening here.[r]::

